<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xml:lang="en"
      xmlns:tal="http://xml.zope.org/namespaces/tal"
      xmlns:i18n="http://xml.zope.org/namespaces/i18n"
      xmlns:metal="http://xml.zope.org/namespaces/metal"
      metal:use-macro="context/main_template/macros/master">
<body>

<metal:title fill-slot="content-title"></metal:title>
<metal:description fill-slot="content-description"></metal:description>

<metal:main fill-slot="content-core"
            tal:define="result python:view.results(); filters python:result['filters']">

  <h1 class="documentFirstHeading" tal:content="python:view.page_title()">Usage Report</h1>
  <p class="text-muted" i18n:translate="stockusage_report_desc1">按起止时间、库存编号、批号、物料名称、供应商查询并导出使用记录（对应「对照品使用记录」交付项）。</p>
  <p class="text-muted" i18n:translate="stockusage_report_desc2">批号一栏同时匹配「厂家批号」与「批次编号」；起止时间针对记录的操作时间，留空表示不限。</p>
  <p class="text-muted" i18n:translate="stockusage_report_desc3">导出内容与当前查询结果完全一致。</p>

  <form method="get" class="row mb-3"
        tal:attributes="action python:view.context_url()">

    <div class="col-md-2 mb-2">
      <label class="small mb-1" for="date_from"
             i18n:translate="stockusage_date_from">起始时间</label>
      <input type="date" class="form-control form-control-sm"
             id="date_from" name="date_from"
             tal:attributes="value python:view.date_input_value('date_from')"/>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-2 mb-2">
      <label class="small mb-1" for="date_to"
             i18n:translate="stockusage_date_to">截止时间</label>
      <input type="date" class="form-control form-control-sm"
             id="date_to" name="date_to"
             tal:attributes="value python:view.date_input_value('date_to')"/>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-2 mb-2">
      <label class="small mb-1" for="stock_number"
             i18n:translate="stockusage_stock_number_only">库存编号</label>
      <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm"
             id="stock_number" name="stock_number" placeholder="RM-001"
             tal:attributes="value python:filters.get('stock_number')"/>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-2 mb-2">
      <label class="small mb-1" for="batch_number"
             i18n:translate="stockusage_batch_number_only">批号 / 批次编号</label>
      <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm"
             id="batch_number" name="batch_number" placeholder="123456"
             tal:attributes="value python:filters.get('batch_number')"/>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-2 mb-2">
      <label class="small mb-1" for="material_name"
             i18n:translate="stockusage_material_name_only">物料名称</label>
      <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm"
             id="material_name" name="material_name" placeholder="fuzzy match"
             tal:attributes="value python:filters.get('material_name')"/>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-2 mb-2">
      <label class="small mb-1" for="supplier_uid"
             i18n:translate="stockusage_supplier_only">供应商</label>
      <select class="form-control form-control-sm" id="supplier_uid" name="supplier_uid">
        <option value="" i18n:translate="stockusage_all">全部</option>
        <option tal:repeat="option python:view.supplier_options()"
                tal:attributes="value python:option['uid'];
                                selected python:'selected' if option['uid'] == filters.get('supplier_uid') else None"
                tal:content="python:option['title']">-</option>
      </select>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-2 mb-2">
      <label class="small mb-1" for="stock_type_uid"
             i18n:translate="stockusage_stock_type_only">库存类型</label>
      <select class="form-control form-control-sm" id="stock_type_uid" name="stock_type_uid">
        <option value="" i18n:translate="stockusage_all">全部</option>
        <option tal:repeat="option python:view.stock_type_options()"
                tal:attributes="value python:option['uid'];
                                selected python:'selected' if option['uid'] == filters.get('stock_type_uid') else None"
                tal:content="python:option['title']">-</option>
      </select>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-2 mb-2">
      <label class="small mb-1" for="page_size"
             i18n:translate="stockusage_page_size">每页条数</label>
      <input type="number" class="form-control form-control-sm" min="1" max="500"
             id="page_size" name="page_size"
             tal:attributes="value python:view.page_size()"/>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-12 mb-2">
      <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary mr-2"
              name="search" value="1" i18n:translate="stockusage_search">查询</button>
      <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary mr-2"
         i18n:translate="stockusage_reset"
         tal:attributes="href python:view.context_url()">重置</a>
      <a class="btn btn-sm btn-success"
         i18n:translate="stockusage_export_csv"
         tal:attributes="href python:view.export_url()">导出 CSV（按当前查询条件）</a>
    </div>
  </form>

  <div class="alert alert-danger py-2" tal:condition="python:result['errors']">
    <div tal:repeat="error python:result['errors']" tal:content="error">-</div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-3"
       tal:content="python:view.summary_text(result['summary'], result['page'], result['pages'])">-</div>

  <div class="alert alert-warning" tal:condition="python:not result['rows']"
       i18n:translate="stockusage_report_no_rows">没有匹配的使用记录，请调整查询条件。</div>

  <div class="table-responsive" tal:condition="python:result['rows']">
    <table class="table table-sm table-striped">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th tal:repeat="column python:view.columns()"
              tal:content="python:column[1]">-</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr tal:repeat="row python:result['rows']">
          <td tal:repeat="column python:view.columns()"
              tal:content="python:row.get(column[0])">-</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <nav tal:condition="python:result['pages'] > 1">
    <ul class="pagination pagination-sm">
      <li class="page-item" tal:condition="python:result['page'] > 1">
        <a class="page-link" i18n:translate="stockusage_prev_page"
           tal:attributes="href python:view.page_url(result['page'] - 1)">Previous</a>
      </li>
      <li class="page-item disabled">
        <span class="page-link"
              tal:content="python:view.page_indicator(result['page'], result['pages'])">-</span>
      </li>
      <li class="page-item" tal:condition="python:result['page'] != result['pages']">
        <a class="page-link" i18n:translate="stockusage_next_page"
           tal:attributes="href python:view.page_url(result['page'] + 1)">Next</a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </nav>

</metal:main>
</body>
</html>
